{"2756180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Alawon: Life of a Game Composer", "steam_appid": 2756180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live the lo-fi life of a  bedroom game composer.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage a game composer career</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train 3 music skills: <strong>instruments</strong>, <strong>production</strong>, and <strong>music theory</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Build a portfolio, grow your following, and compose for game developer clients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow a realistic game composer journey; start with game jams, and eventually become the legendary composer of blockbuster AAA titles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756180/extras/d143e417412da637de9f4a5065cd31cc.poster.avif?t=1785599899\" width=1170 height=534 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756180/extras/d143e417412da637de9f4a5065cd31cc.webm?t=1785599899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756180/extras/d143e417412da637de9f4a5065cd31cc.mp4?t=1785599899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deep simulation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > NPCs have independent homes, schedules, jobs, and simulated lives over 24-hour days and a 365-day calendar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attend world events including public holidays, musical trends, live shows, and game audio conferences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your smartwatch monitors your <strong>Energy</strong>, <strong>Hunger</strong>, <strong>Stress</strong>, and <strong>Inspiration</strong>. Manage your needs as you balance your social life with your career. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756180/extras/81eb343d4403ab88a2fb84e3ec73ebc2.poster.avif?t=1785599899\" width=1170 height=534 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756180/extras/81eb343d4403ab88a2fb84e3ec73ebc2.webm?t=1785599899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756180/extras/81eb343d4403ab88a2fb84e3ec73ebc2.mp4?t=1785599899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Compose real music</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express your creativity using Alawon's easy Digital Audio Workstation (DAW).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own chords, beats, and melodies  — or use pre-written blocks.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Share your creations with other players on Twitch, or export and listen anywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756180/extras/db0a4e9a74fc0ded43d5df7de966df1c.poster.avif?t=1785599899\" width=1170 height=534 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756180/extras/db0a4e9a74fc0ded43d5df7de966df1c.webm?t=1785599899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756180/extras/db0a4e9a74fc0ded43d5df7de966df1c.mp4?t=1785599899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756180/extras/b81e9f3458fa29b23f4ddf5da50a0073.poster.avif?t=1785599899\" width=1170 height=534 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756180/extras/b81e9f3458fa29b23f4ddf5da50a0073.webm?t=1785599899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756180/extras/b81e9f3458fa29b23f4ddf5da50a0073.mp4?t=1785599899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow relationships</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a vibrant cast of characters and learn their hopes, dreams, and fears as they become a part of your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756180/extras/b9413fccfd2f74d7c1c9cd9eafebe72e.poster.avif?t=1785599899\" width=1170 height=534 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756180/extras/b9413fccfd2f74d7c1c9cd9eafebe72e.webm?t=1785599899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756180/extras/b9413fccfd2f74d7c1c9cd9eafebe72e.mp4?t=1785599899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support your friends, and in return they'll offer gifts and perks to help you make better music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover 10 character stories and 8 romance options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756180/extras/dd087cabffa78b02efa047b3110fd804.poster.avif?t=1785599899\" width=1170 height=534 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756180/extras/dd087cabffa78b02efa047b3110fd804.webm?t=1785599899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756180/extras/dd087cabffa78b02efa047b3110fd804.mp4?t=1785599899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Branching  story with 4 endings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A parasite has infected the music industry in Alawon. Compositions are being stolen by generative AI, and Big Music is obsessed with amassing DAWCoin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow in status and uncover the dark secrets of the industry. Will you save the industry and make composing free for everyone, or will you exploit human creativity to become a greedy music tycoon?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrades</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy new homes to unlock major life improvements such as a cat, louder instruments, marriage, and eventually a luxury home studio. But mostly a cat.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incremental/idle mini-game: find the balance of 3 different component upgrades to optimise DAWCoin mining speeds. Number go up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new instruments and blocks for use when composing — as gifts from friends, or buy them in the music shop.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live the lo-fi life of a  bedroom game composer.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage a game composer career</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train 3 music skills: <strong>instruments</strong>, <strong>production</strong>, and <strong>music theory</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Build a portfolio, grow your following, and compose for game developer clients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow a realistic game composer journey; start with game jams, and eventually become the legendary composer of blockbuster AAA titles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756180/extras/d143e417412da637de9f4a5065cd31cc.poster.avif?t=1785599899\" width=1170 height=534 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756180/extras/d143e417412da637de9f4a5065cd31cc.webm?t=1785599899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756180/extras/d143e417412da637de9f4a5065cd31cc.mp4?t=1785599899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deep simulation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > NPCs have independent homes, schedules, jobs, and simulated lives over 24-hour days and a 365-day calendar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attend world events including public holidays, musical trends, live shows, and game audio conferences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your smartwatch monitors your <strong>Energy</strong>, <strong>Hunger</strong>, <strong>Stress</strong>, and <strong>Inspiration</strong>. Manage your needs as you balance your social life with your career. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756180/extras/81eb343d4403ab88a2fb84e3ec73ebc2.poster.avif?t=1785599899\" width=1170 height=534 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756180/extras/81eb343d4403ab88a2fb84e3ec73ebc2.webm?t=1785599899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756180/extras/81eb343d4403ab88a2fb84e3ec73ebc2.mp4?t=1785599899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Compose real music</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express your creativity using Alawon's easy Digital Audio Workstation (DAW).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own chords, beats, and melodies  — or use pre-written blocks.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Share your cre