nent upgrades to optimise DAWCoin mining speeds. Number go up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new instruments and blocks for use when composing — as gifts from friends, or buy them in the music shop.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Alawon is a life sim where you manage a game composer career. Rise from game jams to AAA, balancing life and work. Make money, make friends, make love, and make music in Alawon's Digital Audio Workstation — then export and share your creations to make your mother very proud.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Welsh<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756180/7aa3322c30910d38f411fafcc2dc1fa1622f1a73/header.jpg?t=1785599899", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756180/b49d757f89c30560ddd8e27f756dd846ff486dda/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785599899", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756180/b49d757f89c30560ddd8e27f756dd846ff486dda/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785599899", "website": "https://musclecat.games/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4670K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GForce GTX TITAN X<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS 3<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Zen 2 4c/8t, 2.4-3.5GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 8 RDNA 2 CUs, 1.6GHz<br></li><li><strong>